  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b> The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Verpine\" title=\"Verpine\">Verpine</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a>) </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b> Any Armor, Any Ranged Energy Weapon </p><p>The insectoid Verpine are technological masters who can create items with exceptional characteristics. </p><p><b>Weapons:</b> As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, a Verpine Weapon can be switched to an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> fire mode, changing the Weapon to deal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> damage instead of normal damage (at the same damage dice). However, Verpine Weapons are designed for the Verpine's unique physiology, and they require the wearer have a minimum <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> score of 13 to wield the weapon properly (otherwise, the wielder takes a -2 penalty to attack rolls with that Weapon). </p><p><b>Armors:</b> A suit of Verpine Armor provides <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 10 against <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> damage. However, Verpine Armor is designed for the Verpine's unique physiology, and they require the wearer have a minimum <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> score of 13 to wear the armor effectively (otherwise, the wearer suffers from <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Armor_Check_Penalties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Check Penalties\">Armor Check Penalties</a>). </p>",
